	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Visus est nobis <persName ref="p2019">Maynardus</persName> vir bonus, sincerus et boni exempli, quamobrem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>testimonium contulimus, quod nimirum vidisti.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Alioqui erant in <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>confessione, quę nonnihil nos moverant, quę et exposuimus; attamen, quia sanus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in ipso animus cognitus est, et quę moverant, non ita magni erant <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>momenti, ut veritati derogare possent, arbitrati sumus, senium illud <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non esse amplius perturbandum, postquam ab adversariis stultissimis fuerat per<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>turbatum satis antea.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Verum credo, quod omnia tibi exposuerit abunde, quę <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>cum ipso transegimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Nova sunt: Cęsar iniunxit electori <persName ref="p18520">Brandenburgensi</persName> et <persName ref="p18250">Mauricio</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ut <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgum</placeName> obsideant, et iam <persName ref="p18250">Mauricius</persName> huic expeditioni n<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ecessaria parat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Is cognita Cęsaris voluntate diem non expectarat, sed <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nocte intempesta abiit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p7459">Comes Burensis</persName> cum exercitu versus <placeName ref="l642">Frisiam <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Superiorem</placeName> dicitur proficisci, ut eam ditionem et <placeName ref="l61">Bremensem</placeName> Cęsari subiiciat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>De <placeName ref="l257">Constantia</placeName> intellexi ex <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensi</placeName> vehementer eam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>esse anxiam, quod Cęsar Interim istud conatur obtrudere, quod vult, ut <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>pfaffos recipiat, quod civitatem vult domui <placeName ref="l850">Austrię</placeName> prorsus patere <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quodque pecuniam satis petit magnam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Rumor praeterea venit ad <lb xml:id="p1z18"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> (id quod ad me scripserunt heri <persName ref="p5957">Theobaldus Nigri</persName> et <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName> quidam nobilis) <placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName> omnes communi consensu auxilium illis et <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>defensionem contra Cęsarem obtulisse; verum idne sit annon, tu nosse potes.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Fertur et illud rumore: ad kalendas augusti Cęsarem statibus comitia <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nova indixisse <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName>; quod si verum, periit <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Praelegit <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>his diebus <persName ref="p714">Caelius</persName> Angelos novo praelio fudisse <placeName ref="l2524">Scotos</placeName> una cum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l822">Germanis</placeName> missis a <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> et <placeName ref="l2472">Boloniam Novam</placeName> captam et evangelium <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>continenter capere augmentum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De tyrannide Cęsaris in religione et <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandi</persName> in politia <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> ipse nosti; graviora nunquam au<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>divi; opus est multis et devotis precibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Iudicium tuum peto de concionibus 15 Michaelis suffraganei pro r<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>estituenda missa, imo de bono missę.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quęso te, ne illo me prives.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Mihi videtur hominem versipellem non semel loqui contra conscientiam suam.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Videtur et illud: eundem congessisse bonam partem Interim Cęsariani.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Qui has tibi, ut tandem finiam, reddit, M. <persName ref="p2463">Heinrichus Pantaleon</persName> est; <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>anno superiore decanus fuit academię nostrę facultatis artium, diaconus <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>D. <persName ref="p3988">Wolfii</persName>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Amare videtur me; propterea et ipsum redamo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Nunquam <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>fuit <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>; voluit vos invisere et adloqui.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Tu, si quid in eum con<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>tuleris, mihi contulisti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino cum tuis, cum <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>et <persName ref="p8459">Ottone</persName>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Dimisi nuperrime per studiosum <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinum</placeName>, qui hic d<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>eposuerat mores bachantium, literas ad <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerum</persName> mittendas; quęso, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>certiorem me reddas, an acceperis.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 21. iunii <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>anno 1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>T(uus) <persName ref="p8418">Os(valdus) Myconius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>doctissimo, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>antistiti, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>in domino observando suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
